id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41606::$$$message_0315_0000_0000$$$::"'Rin (left) and Sakura (right) show up dressed as Edelfelts, early in the story. There are a lot of characters in dresses this time, and we ran out of ideas.' [line len=2]Character Artist"::
41607::$$$message_0315_0001_0000$$$::"Yeah, this one.[br]They gave us such luxurious, romantic outfits. It made me a little teary-eyed."::
41608::$$$message_0315_0002_0000$$$::"I'm pleased to hear that.[br]You probably still don't fully understand what happened in that scene, do you?"::
41609::$$$message_0315_0003_0000$$$::"Women have as many faces as they do dresses."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
41610::$$$message_0315_0004_0000$$$::"...As long as that's good enough for you."::

